sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser as Browser (React SPA)
    participant Auth as Auth Service (bionicpro-auth)
    participant Redis as Redis (Session Store)
    participant Keycloak as Keycloak (IdP)

    Note over User,Keycloak: 1. Начало аутентификации

    User->>Browser: Нажимает "Login"
    Browser->>Auth: GET /auth/login
    Auth-->>Browser: 302 Redirect to Keycloak
    Browser->>Keycloak: GET /auth?client_id=...&redirect_uri=...

    Note over User,Keycloak: 2. Аутентификация в Keycloak

    Keycloak->>Browser: Страница логина
    User->>Keycloak: Вводит credentials
    Keycloak->>Keycloak: Валидация пользователя
    Keycloak-->>Browser: 302 Redirect with code

    Note over Browser,Redis: 3. Обмен code на сессию

    Browser->>Auth: GET /auth/callback?code=...
    Auth->>Keycloak: POST /token (code + client_secret)
    Keycloak-->>Auth: access_token + refresh_token
    Auth->>Auth: Декодирует access_token (получает user data)
    Auth->>Redis: SET session:{session_id} (tokens + user)
    Redis-->>Auth: OK
    Auth-->>Browser: 200 OK + Set-Cookie: session_id
    Browser->>Browser: Сохраняет session_id cookie

    Note over Browser,Redis: 4. Проверка аутентификации

    Browser->>Auth: GET /auth/me (Cookie: session_id)
    Auth->>Redis: GET session:{session_id}
    Redis-->>Auth: session data

    alt access_token валиден
        Auth->>Auth: Проверяет access_token TTL
        Auth-->>Browser: 200 OK (user data)
    else access_token истек
        Auth->>Auth: Обнаруживает истекший access_token
        Auth->>Keycloak: POST /token (refresh_token)
        Keycloak-->>Auth: new access_token
        Auth->>Redis: UPDATE session:{session_id} (new tokens)
        Auth-->>Browser: 200 OK (user data)
    end

    Note over Browser,Redis: 5. Ротация сессии (при каждом запросе)

    Browser->>Auth: GET /auth/me (Cookie: session_id_old)
    Auth->>Redis: GET session:{session_id_old}
    Redis-->>Auth: session data
    Auth->>Redis: DELETE session:{session_id_old}
    Auth->>Redis: SET session:{session_id_new}
    Auth-->>Browser: 200 OK + Set-Cookie: session_id_new

    Note over Browser,Keycloak: 6. Выход из системы

    User->>Browser: Нажимает "Logout"
    Browser->>Auth: POST /auth/logout (Cookie: session_id)
    Auth->>Redis: GET session:{session_id}
    Redis-->>Auth: session data
    Auth->>Keycloak: POST /logout (refresh_token)
    Auth->>Redis: DELETE session:{session_id}
    Auth-->>Browser: 200 OK + Delete-Cookie: session_id